 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.232,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 2.983
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "共识，是网络里的节点，就哪条链是正确的，达成一致的机制。",
   "spoken": "共识，是网络里的节点，就哪条链是正确的，达成一致的机制。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.052,
   "dur": 5.784,
   "speechStart": 4.15,
   "speechEnd": 8.995
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "重组，是节点放弃已经接受的几个区块，改为接受另一条链。",
   "spoken": "虫组，是节点放弃已经接受的几个区块，改为接受另一条链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.056,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 10.154,
   "speechEnd": 14.844
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "已经确认的交易，会在重组里消失。",
   "spoken": "已经确认的交易，会在虫组里消失。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.892,
   "dur": 3.552,
   "speechStart": 15.99,
   "speechEnd": 18.597
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "所以交易所说的已确认，只是对这条链安全假设的一个赌注。",
   "spoken": "所以交易所说的已确认，只是对这条链安全假设的一个赌注。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 19.664,
   "dur": 5.328,
   "speechStart": 19.762,
   "speechEnd": 24.143
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "打个比方。",
   "spoken": "打个比方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.212,
   "dur": 1.872,
   "speechStart": 25.31,
   "speechEnd": 26.095
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "一个城市的公证处，靠多数公证员签字，确认房产交易。",
   "spoken": "一个城市的公证处，靠多数公证员签字，确认房产交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 27.304,
   "dur": 5.808,
   "speechStart": 27.402,
   "speechEnd": 32.271
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "如果有人临时雇来半数以上的公证员。",
   "spoken": "如果有人临时雇来半数以上的公证员。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.332,
   "dur": 3.336,
   "speechStart": 33.43,
   "speechEnd": 35.834
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "他可以让一份盖过章的合同作废，再把同一套房卖给另一个人。",
   "spoken": "他可以让一份盖过章的合同作废，再把同一套房卖给另一个人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 36.888,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 36.986,
   "speechEnd": 41.319
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "这就是双花，同一笔资产被花两次。",
   "spoken": "这就是双花，同一笔资产被花两次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 42.388,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 42.486,
   "speechEnd": 45.557
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "比喻不成立的地方是，现实里雇公证员要花很多年。",
   "spoken": "比喻不成立的地方是，现实里雇公证员要花很多年。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 46.616,
   "dur": 5.184,
   "speechStart": 46.714,
   "speechEnd": 50.975
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "在小算力的 PoW 链上，算力可以按小时租。",
   "spoken": "在小算力的 PoW 链上，算力可以按小时租。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.02,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 52.118,
   "speechEnd": 55.189
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "很多人把所有共识攻击，都叫 51% 攻击。",
   "spoken": "很多人把所有共识攻击，都叫百分之 51 攻击。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 56.248,
   "dur": 4.176,
   "speechStart": 56.346,
   "speechEnd": 59.584
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "这会选错防线。",
   "spoken": "这会选错防线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 60.644,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 60.742,
   "speechEnd": 61.884
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "更好的问法是，攻击者控制了什么。",
   "spoken": "更好的问法是，攻击者控制了什么。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
